<title>LEBANON: Yields mixed on Lebanese treasury bills.</title>
<headline>Yields mixed on Lebanese treasury bills.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields were mixed on Lebanese treasury bills, according to weekly rates issued by the central bank on Monday.</p>
<p>It announced the following interest rates for its September 9 issues (previous week in brackets):</p>
<p>    Term		    Discount		     Yield</p>
<p>				(percent)		   (percent)</p>
<p>    Three months	  14.10 (14.22)	     14.61  (14.74)</p>
<p>    Six months	    15.60 (15.63)	     16.92  (16.95)</p>
<p>    12 months	     15.15 (15.15)	     17.85  (17.85)</p>
<p>    24 months   (Interest payable twice yearly) 21.76  (21.76)</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial  (961 1)  864148  602056  645456</p>
</text>
